# Mastra MCP — docs lookup for iPixai

**Live config:** `~/.cursor/mcp.json` → server id **`mastra`** (Cursor exposes as **`user-mastra`**).  
**Official:** [Build with AI](https://mastra.ai/docs/getting-started/build-with-ai) · [mastra.ai/llms.txt](https://mastra.ai/llms.txt)  
**Runtime SSOT:** `docs/copilotkit-mastra/README.md` + `docs/mastra/runtime-family.md`

## Skills vs MCP

| Layer | When to use |
|-------|-------------|
| **Mastra skills** | Setup, best practices, CLI |
| **`user-mastra` MCP** | Embedded package search, exports, `mastraMigration` |
| **Installed `node_modules/@mastra/*`** | API truth — grep before guessing signatures |
| **Remote `.md` / `llms.txt`** | MCP miss or path 404 |

Never trust training-data Mastra APIs. Never copy old iPix APIs just because they compile.

## `projectPath` (required for embedded-doc tools)

This repo’s Mastra packages live at the **repo root** (not old iPix `app/`).

```bash
echo "$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)"
```

Pass that as `projectPath` on `searchMastraDocs`, `readMastraDocs`, `listMastraPackages`, `getMastraExports`.

## Tool pick (`user-mastra`)

| Need | Tool | Required args |
|------|------|---------------|
| Full doc page by path | **`mastraDocs`** | `paths` |
| Browse embedded package docs | **`readMastraDocs`** | `package`, **`projectPath`** |
| Keyword search in installed docs | **`searchMastraDocs`** | `query`, **`projectPath`** |
| List installed `@mastra/*` | **`listMastraPackages`** | **`projectPath`** |
| Export / API surface | **`getMastraExports`** | `package`, **`projectPath`** |
| v0 → v1 migration | **`mastraMigration`** | per schema |

## Agent workflow

1. Change under `src/mastra/` → this rule + `docs/copilotkit-mastra/README.md` + installed types.
2. Need a doc page → `mastraDocs`.
3. Need installed API → `searchMastraDocs` / `readMastraDocs` with **this repo’s** `projectPath`.
4. MCP empty → `https://mastra.ai/docs/....md` or `llms.txt`.

## iPixai wiring (do not resurrect old iPix)

| Topic | iPixai |
|-------|--------|
| Code location | `src/mastra/` |
| CopilotKit | In-process `MastraAgent.getLocalAgents({ mastra, resourceId })` |
| `resourceId` | `org:{orgId}::user:{userId}` — never hardcoded `"default"` in Core |
| Storage | PostgresStore + preview `mastra` schema; **no** LibSQL in prod path; **no** Worker storage switch |
| Agent IDs | `default` + `production-planner` first; more IDs per convert plan |
| Dev | `npm run dev:agent` on `:4111` — **not** combined `npm run dev` |
| Models | Starter pin until a provider ticket; do not port Cloudflare `resolveAgentModel` |

## Node

Mastra docs MCP expects **Node.js ≥ 22.13.0**. If `user-mastra` is error-only, upgrade Node and restart Cursor.

